ainst any deployed resource (e.g., a database), it can be extracted by any party with repository read access or state backend access. Even if the variable is overridden at deploy time, the default value persists in git history and may be mistakenly used in non-production deployments.\n  - Recommendation: Remove the default value entirely so that Terraform requires the caller to supply the password explicitly at plan/apply time. Source the secret from a secure store such as Azure Key Vault (via a data source), a CI/CD secret variable, or a secrets management tool. If the default has already been committed, rotate the credential and consider the previous value permanently compromised. Example: remove the 'default' attribute and retrieve the value with 'data \"azurerm_key_vault_secret\"' or pass it via a TF_VAR_ environment variable from the pipeline secrets store.\n\n### Policy mappings\n- **SEC-001** — No resource should be publicly exposed unless explicitly required and justified. (finding F-001)\n\n### Recommendation\nReview and remediate the confirmed findings above.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/abdulwaheed384/ai-pr-review/issues/comments/6147334647/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":{"id":15368,"client_id":"Iv1.05c79e9ad1f6bdfa","slug":"github-actions","node_id":"MDM6QXBwMTUzNjg=","owner":{"login":"github","id":9919,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjk5MTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github","html_url":"https://github.com/github","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht